  "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Update History | SF6 Frame Data Search</title>\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/fds_ico.ico\">\n  <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex\">\n  <script async src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-2100199637211463\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n  <script>(function(){var t=localStorage.getItem('fds-theme');if(t==='light'||t==='dark')document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t;})()</script>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/fds-theme.css\">\n  <style>\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  background: var(--fds-bg-page);\n  color: var(--fds-text-primary);\n  font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  margin: 0;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\na { color: var(--fds-link-color); text-decoration: none; }\na:hover { text-decoration: underline; opacity: 0.82; }\n\n.hist-wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5em 1em 2em; }\n.hist-back { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; color: var(--fds-link-color); font-size: 0.95em; margin-bottom: 1.8em; }\n.hist-back:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n.hist-title { font-size: 1.6em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--fds-header-text); margin: 0 0 0.2em; border: none; padding: 0; }\n.hist-sub { color: var(--fds-text-secondary); font-size: 0.88em; margin-bottom: 2em; }\n\n.timeline { position: relative; padding-left: 1.6em; }\n.timeline::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 4px;\n  top: 8px;\n  bottom: 0;\n  width: 2px;\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #539bf5 0%, #444c56 70%, transparent 100%);\n}\n.tl-entry { position: relative; margin-bottom: 1.8em; }\n.tl-dot {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: -1.6em;\n  top: 0.38em;\n  width: 10px;\n  height: 10px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #539bf5;\n  border: 2px solid var(--fds-bg-page);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #539bf5;\n}\n.tl-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 0.6em; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n.tl-date { font-size: 1em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--fds-header-text); }\n.tl-ver {\n  font-size: 0.75em;\n  background: var(--fds-bg-card);\n  color: var(--fds-text-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--fds-border);\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  padding: 1px 10px;\n  font-family: monospace;\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n}\n.tl-items { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }\n.tl-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 8px;\n  background: var(--fds-bg-card);\n  border: 1px solid var(--fds-border);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 9px 13px;\n  font-size: 0.93em;\n  color: var(--fds-text-primary);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n.badge {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  font-size: 0.7em;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  padding: 2px 7px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n}\n.b-new  { background: rgba(87,171,90,0.18);  color: #57ab5a; border: 1px solid rgba(87,171,90,0.35); }\n.b-fix  { background: rgba(220,80,60,0.15);  color: #f0816e; border: 1px solid rgba(220,80,60,0.35); }\n.b-data { background: rgba(83,155,245,0.15); color: #79c0ff; border: 1px solid rgba(83,155,245,0.3); }\n.b-vid  { background: rgba(163,113,247,0.15); color: #d2a8ff; border: 1px solid rgba(163,113,247,0.3); }\n.b-ui     { background: rgba(227,179,65,0.15);  color: #e3b341; border: 1px solid rgba(227,179,65,0.3); }\n.b-change { background: rgba(130,100,200,0.15); color: #b392f0; border: 1px solid rgba(130,100,200,0.35); }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"hist-wrap\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:1.8em;\">\n    <a class=\"hist-back\" href=\"/?lang=en-us\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">← Back to Street Fighter 6 Frame Data Search</a>\n    <button onclick=\"_themeCycle()\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:4px 10px;border:1px solid var(--fds-border);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.88em;font-family:inherit;background:none;color:var(--fds-link-color);cursor:pointer;\" id=\"fds-theme-btn\"></button>\n  </div>\n  <h2 class=\"hist-title\">Update History</h2>\n  <p class=\"hist-sub\">Street Fighter 6 Frame Data Search</p>\n\n  <div class=\"timeline\">\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/11/04</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-fix\">Fix</span><div>\n          <span>Corrected Modern controls commands for the following moves.</span>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:0.5em;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.8;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-top:0.4em\"><strong>Removed incorrect commands for moves unavailable in Modern controls</strong>\n              <ul style=\"margin:0.1em 0 0 1.2em;padding:0;\">\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Alex\">Alex</a>: Standing MK (Middle Kick)</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Zangief\">Zangief</a>: Standing MK (Middle Kick)</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Ken\">Ken</a>: Crouching MP (Straight), Light Hadoken, Medium Hadoken</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Terry\">Terry</a>: Standing LK (Low Kick)</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Ryu\">Ryu</a>: Light Tatsumaki, Heavy Tatsumaki</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"margin-top:0.4em\"><strong>Fixed incorrect commands</strong>\n              <ul style=\"margin:0.1em 0 0 1.2em;padding:0;\">\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Guile\">Guile</a>: Crouching LP (Jab)</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=M.Bison\">M. Bison</a>: Crouching LP (Jab)</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Kimberly\">Kimberly</a>: Quick Stop</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Ed\">Ed</a>: Standing LP (Jab)</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Sagat\">Sagat</a>: Standing LK (Low Kick)</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Zangief\">Zangief</a>: Standing LK (Low Kick)</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Ryu\">Ryu</a>: Heavy Hadoken, OD Hadoken, Medium Shoryuken, Heavy Shoryuken, Medium Tatsumaki, OD Tatsumaki</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=Akuma\">Akuma</a>: Parry Drive Rush</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/11/02</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Added <strong>\"Modern\"</strong> and <strong>\"Classic Only\"</strong> system tags to the tag filter. Filter by \"Modern\" to show moves available in Modern controls, or \"Classic Only\" for moves unavailable in Modern controls.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Added display of Modern controls commands.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/31</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>PC: Added <strong>Abbreviation</strong> feature. Toggle it via the <strong>Abbreviations</strong> button in the sidebar. Abbreviates move names, commands, and stats labels using built-in presets or your own custom rules. An <strong>Include stats</strong> checkbox lets you control stats label abbreviation independently.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>PC: Click the <strong>✏</strong> icon next to any move name to open the abbreviation editor with that move pre-filled in the \"From\" field.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-change\">Update</span><span>New preset abbreviation rules added for stats labels — e.g. \"Frame Start-up\" → \"Startup\", \"Drive Gauge Increase Hit\" → \"Drive Gain (Hit)\". <span style=\"color:#e3b341;font-weight:700;\">Existing users:</span> open the abbreviation editor (PC sidebar or mobile ⚙ menu → \"Edit custom abbreviations\") and click <strong>\"Restore default presets\"</strong> to apply the new rules.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/30</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Added a feature guide page. Get an overview of all features via the <a href=\"/guide?lang=en-us\" target=\"_blank\">Guide</a> link in the header.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/25</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Major UI overhaul for mobile. The view is now list-based, letting you see more moves at a glance.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Column visibility can now be configured via the ⚙ icon. Customize which columns are shown.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Abbreviated notation can be toggled on or off (abbreviated by default).</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Tap a row to view full move details in the previous card style.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/24</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Added Pin feature. Click the <svg width=\"13\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 13\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin:0 2px;\"><ellipse cx=\"5\" cy=\"4.5\" rx=\"4\" ry=\"3.5\"/><rect x=\"4.4\" y=\"8\" width=\"1.2\" height=\"4.5\" rx=\"0.4\"/></svg> icon on a move row to pin it. Pinned moves appear at the top of search results. Your pins are saved in the browser.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/23</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Added theme switching. Choose from 5 themes: Dark, Light, One Light, Tokyo Night Light, and Nord. Your selection is saved in the browser.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/22</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Added Tag feature. You can tag moves for filtering and organization.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/20</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Added Exclusion List feature. Click the 🗑 icon on any move row to add or remove it from the exclusion list. Excluded moves are hidden from search results.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>The 🗑 button toggles a review mode that shows only moves in the exclusion list. Use the ↩ button to clear the entire exclusion list at once.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/17</span>\n        <span class=\"tl-ver\">Ver.2.0500.001</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-data\">Data</span><span>Re-fetched and updated frame data for all characters and moves to reflect the latest Street Fighter 6 balance patch.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-data\">Data</span><span>Added 6 new moves for <a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=ARJUN\">ARJUN</a>: \"Justice Beyond\", \"OD Justice Beyond\", \"Breathing Shockwave(projectile)\", \"OD Breathing Shockwave(projectile)\", \"Divine Pillar(projectile)\", and \"OD Divine Pillar(projectile)\".</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/16</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>PC: You can now sort by Start-up, Recovery, Hit, and Block columns by clicking the column headers. Sort settings are remembered.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/13</span>\n        <span class=\"tl-ver\">Ver.2.0500.000</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-data\">Data</span><span>Updated frame data to the latest version.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">NEW</span><span><a href=\"/?lang=en-us&character_name=ARJUN\">ARJUN</a>'s frame data are now searchable.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/12</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Added import/share history to the \"Share Save Data\" dialog. You can re-import or re-display past codes from history (up to 10 entries).</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-change\">Change</span><span>Removed the \"Version Diff\" page. Diff information is now shown inline in each move's stats column with markup.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/09</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Published a <a href=\"/usage_en-us.html\" target=\"_blank\">Guide</a> page walking through character matchup practice in SF6.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>PC/Mobile: Clicking a frame condition badge (Startup / Recovery / Hit / Block) now cycles through comparison operators.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>PC: Consolidated the navigation bar into a single compact row.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/10/04</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-change\">Change</span><span>Removed the CSV export feature.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-fix\">Fix</span><span>Fixed an issue where the mobile app (PWA) always launched in Japanese regardless of the user's language preference.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/09/30</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Search conditions and ★ filter state are now automatically restored when you revisit the page. (Shared links and bookmarked searches still work as expected.)</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/09/23</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Mobile: Move names now automatically scale down to fit on a single line.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Mobile: Added ▲▼ scroll snap buttons below the search shortcut FAB to jump between table rows one at a time.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Mobile: Removed the dialog that appeared when tapping a move name.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Mobile: Improved the move detail text area design (added background color and border).</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Mobile: Restyled GIF player control buttons to match the dark theme.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Mobile: Enlarged the ★ bookmark icon for easier tapping.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-fix\">Fix</span><span>Mobile: After applying search conditions or toggling the ★ filter, the page now scrolls to the first data row instead of the table header.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/09/22</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-fix\">Fix</span><span>Fixed an incorrect gif video for E.Honda's crouching HP.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Added saved data sharing feature. Share saved search conditions and ★ bookmarks between PC and mobile, or between mobile devices, using a 6-digit code.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/09/21</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Character sort order is now unified across the site to match the in-game character select screen layout (search results table, chart, dropdown, side pane, and version diff page).</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Added a collapsible side pane. Click the button at the top-right of the title to toggle it. The state is saved in your browser.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Version diff page now excludes newly added characters from the listing.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Various minor display adjustments.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/09/20</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-fix\">Fix</span><span>PC: Fixed an issue where the \"Load Conditions\" button was unresponsive when the table occupied the full viewport.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-new\">New</span><span>Added bookmark feature (PC &amp; mobile). Click ☆ on any move row to bookmark or unbookmark it. Use the ★ button to filter the list to bookmarked moves only. Compound filtering with other search conditions is supported — when the filter is active, only bookmarked moves matching the current conditions are shown.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Redesigned toast notifications to slide in from the right edge of the screen (PC &amp; mobile).</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/09/19</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Revised the PC table layout.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/09/18</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Added a Search History feature. Up to 30 recent searches are saved automatically and accessible from the \"History / Saved / Popular\" button. Supports ascending/descending sort order.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/09/08</span>\n        <span class=\"tl-ver\">Ver.2.0401.010</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-data\">DATA</span><span>Re-fetched and updated frame data for all characters and moves to reflect the latest Street Fighter 6 balance patch.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Added a Save Conditions feature. Save up to 300 search presets and recall them instantly from the \"Saved / Popular Conditions\" button.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/09/07</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span class=\"badge\" style=\"background:rgba(227,179,65,0.15);color:#e3b341;border:1px solid rgba(227,179,65,0.4);\">β</span><span>Added a \"Popular Conditions\" button. Browse the most-searched conditions as a ranked list and click any entry to apply it to your search instantly.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/09/06</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Added a CSV Export button (desktop only). You can download the current search results with all active filters applied as a CSV file.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        <span class=\"tl-date\">2026/08/18</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"tl-items\">\n        <div class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"badge b-ui\">UI</span><span>Added a <a href=\"/changelog?lang=en-us\">Version Diff page</a> that lists all move changes from the previous version.</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tl-entry\">\n      <div class=\"tl-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-header\">\n        